WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.500
Title card: "From skulls and skeletons found in Europe Science reconstructs the development of man."

00:07.500 --> 00:11.500
A skull resting in rock.

00:11.500 --> 00:18.500
Title card: "The Piltdown Man roamed England about 100,000 years ago."

00:18.500 --> 00:24.800
A sculpted bust of Piltdown Man turns toward the camera.

00:24.800 --> 00:25.200
Title card: "The Neanderthal Man."
